[{"id":"cnp_026_q1","topicId":"cnp_026","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"水的密度是 1.0×10³ kg/m³，它的物理意义是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"1 kg 的水体积是 1.0×10³ m³"},{"key":"B","text":"1 m³ 的水质量是 1.0 kg"},{"key":"C","text":"水的质量是 1.0×10³ kg"},{"key":"D","text":"1 m³ 的水质量是 1.0×10³ kg"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"密度表示单位体积的某种物质的质量。","verify":"\"1 m³ 的水质量是 1.0×10³ kg\""},{"id":"cnp_026_q2","topicId":"cnp_026","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"一块金属质量 54 g，体积 20 cm³，它的密度是多少？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"1080 g/cm³"},{"key":"B","text":"2.7 g/cm³"},{"key":"C","text":"0.37 g/cm³"},{"key":"D","text":"2.7 kg/m³"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"ρ = m/V = 54 g ÷ 20 cm³ = 2.7 g/cm³（铝）。","verify":"54/20"},{"id":"cnp_026_q3","topicId":"cnp_026","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"把一瓶油用去一半，剩下的油密度怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"变为原来的一半"},{"key":"B","text":"变为原来的 2 倍"},{"key":"C","text":"无法判断"},{"key":"D","text":"不变"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"密度是物质的特性，与质量、体积无关；质量和体积都减半，比值不变。","verify":"\"不变\""},{"id":"cnp_026_q4","topicId":"cnp_026","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"2.7 g/cm³ 等于多少 kg/m³？（只填数值）","answer":"2700","explanation":"1 g/cm³ = 1000 kg/m³，所以 2.7 g/cm³ = 2700 kg/m³。","verify":"2.7*1000"}]
